    <villain:personalityDetails>Tyrant: Extremely cruel and lacks empathy. | Cleverness: Devises strategies effectively. | Charisma: Capable of leading armies. | Obsession: Power (cursed Narnia to maintain power and keep it in perpetual winter). | Narcissism: Self-centeredness. | Disorder: Delusional - Believes that only they can rule Narnia and must do so.</villain:personalityDetails>
