    <villain:personalityTrait>Nihilism</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityDetails>Predestined Malevolence: Theological Determinism — Operating under a preordained destiny as the Antichrist, where evil is not a choice but an inherent biological and spiritual essence | Son of a demon: Megalomanical Entitlement. Satanic Sovereignty. Believing in his absolute right to rule the Earth as the rightful heir to his father (Satan), driven by a grand sense of divine, albeit dark, purpose. | Nihilism: Misanthropic Detachment — Viewing humanity as a weak, failing species that requires purging, exhibiting a total lack of empathy and a cold indifference toward human suffering</villain:personalityDetails>
    <schema1:description>Predestined Malevolence: Theological Determinism — Operating under a preordained destiny as the Antichrist, where evil is not a choice but an inherent biological and spiritual essence | Son of a demon: Megalomanical Entitlement. Satanic Sovereignty. Believing in his absolute right to rule the Earth as the rightful heir to his father (Satan), driven by a grand sense of divine, albeit dark, purpose. | Nihilism: Misanthropic Detachment — Viewing humanity as a weak, failing species that requires purging, exhibiting a total lack of empathy and a cold indifference toward human suffering</schema1:description>
    <villain:abilities>Impeccable immunity: Never falls ill; Causes malfunctions in machinery; Induces hallucinations; Can twist human hearts; Can control animals like dogs, horses, etc.</villain:abilities>
