    <foaf:age rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">60</foaf:age>
    <villain:facialFeatures>Long, pointed, and twitching nose</villain:facialFeatures>
    <villain:distinctiveFeatures>Tall; Wearing a long black frock coat, a top hat, and a dark cape; </villain:distinctiveFeatures>
    <villain:personalityTraits>Deception; Sadistic; Obsession; Loyalty</villain:personalityTraits>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Deception"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Sadistic"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Obsession"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Loyalty"/>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Deception</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Sadistic</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Obsession</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Loyalty</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityDetails>Deception: Utilizing a high-pitched, sing-song voice and the promise of free sweets (lollipops, treacle tart) to exploit children’s innocence and desires. | Sadistic: Deriving overt pleasure from the terror of his victims, viewing the capture of children not just as a job for the Baroness, but as a deeply gratifying personal sport. | Obsession: Possessing a pathological focus on the "scent" of children, which he uses to dehumanize them into mere prey to be scented and bagged. | Loyalty: Operating as the official enforcement arm of the Vulgarian regime's anti-child laws, showing total compliance with authority while exercising his own brand of cruelty.</villain:personalityDetails>
    <schema1:description>Deception: Utilizing a high-pitched, sing-song voice and the promise of free sweets (lollipops, treacle tart) to exploit children’s innocence and desires. | Sadistic: Deriving overt pleasure from the terror of his victims, viewing the capture of children not just as a job for the Baroness, but as a deeply gratifying personal sport. | Obsession: Possessing a pathological focus on the "scent" of children, which he uses to dehumanize them into mere prey to be scented and bagged. | Loyalty: Operating as the official enforcement arm of the Vulgarian regime's anti-child laws, showing total compliance with authority while exercising his own brand of cruelty.</schema1:description>
    <villain:abilities>Sensitive nose</villain:abilities>
    <schema1:knowsAbout>Sensitive nose</schema1:knowsAbout>
