    <villain:personalityDetails>Obsession: Pursuing a fanatical obsession with a deceased lover to recreate or replace her through technological means. | Vengefulness: Executing calculated revenge driven by deep-seated hatred to destroy a rival and their legacy. | Delusion: Losing the grip on reality due to emotional instability and confusing living individuals with a lost past. | Manipulation: Feigning cooperation with authority while orchestrating chaos to fulfill a private agenda. | Egotism: Perceiving oneself as a god-like creator while disregarding moral boundaries for technical achievement.</villain:personalityDetails>
