    <villain:personalityTrait>Cynical Pragmatism</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Reputational Fixation</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Moral Collapse</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityDetails>Corruption: Moral Compromise — Sacrificing personal integrity and long-standing values to maintain political power within a corrupt party machine. | Cynical Pragmatism: Rationalized Betrayal — Dismissing the betrayal of public trust as a necessary evil for survival in a "realistic" political landscape. | Reputational Fixation: Prioritizing the maintenance of a heroic public image while concealing clandestine involvement in illicit corporate interests. | Moral Collapse: Experiencing a catastrophic internal fracture when the conflict between past idealism and present corruption becomes irreconcilable.</villain:personalityDetails>
    <schema1:description>Corruption: Moral Compromise — Sacrificing personal integrity and long-standing values to maintain political power within a corrupt party machine. | Cynical Pragmatism: Rationalized Betrayal — Dismissing the betrayal of public trust as a necessary evil for survival in a "realistic" political landscape. | Reputational Fixation: Prioritizing the maintenance of a heroic public image while concealing clandestine involvement in illicit corporate interests. | Moral Collapse: Experiencing a catastrophic internal fracture when the conflict between past idealism and present corruption becomes irreconcilable.</schema1:description>
