    <villain:personalityDetails>Survivalism: Driven by an overwhelming, subconscious fear of death and isolation, prioritizing personal continuity over the collective survival of the species. | Narcissism: Self-Justifying Martyrdom — Rationalizing his betrayal and murders as necessary sacrifices for the "greater good" (Plan B), believing only he possesses the resolve to ensure the mission's success.</villain:personalityDetails>
