    <villain:personalityTrait>Cleverness</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityDetails>Externalized Blame: Victim Mentality — Projecting personal misfortune and physical suffering onto others to justify destructive and vengeful behavior. | Volatile Instability: Chronic Agitation — Maintaining a state of constant irritability and unpredictable rage driven by the inability to control newfound power and physical pain. | Desperate Opportunism: Survivalist Corruption — Willingness to engage in high-stakes criminal activities or align with malevolent forces solely as a means to alleviate pain or regain a semblance of normalcy.</villain:personalityDetails>
    <schema1:description>Externalized Blame: Victim Mentality — Projecting personal misfortune and physical suffering onto others to justify destructive and vengeful behavior. | Volatile Instability: Chronic Agitation — Maintaining a state of constant irritability and unpredictable rage driven by the inability to control newfound power and physical pain. | Desperate Opportunism: Survivalist Corruption — Willingness to engage in high-stakes criminal activities or align with malevolent forces solely as a means to alleviate pain or regain a semblance of normalcy.</schema1:description>
