    <villain:personalityDetails>Paranoia: Projecting deep-seated insecurities onto others through obsessive suspicion and unfounded accusations of betrayal. | Volatile Aggression: Relying on physical violence as the primary mode of communication, failing to distinguish between the boxing ring and domestic life. | Masochistic Atonement: Seeking physical suffering and punishment as a subconscious method of atoning for internal shame and perceived moral failures. | Toxic Inarticulacy: Lacking the capacity to process or express complex emotions, leading to the alienation and emotional abuse of those providing support</villain:personalityDetails>
