    <villain:personalityTrait>Charisma</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityDetails>Obsession: Driven by a lifelong fixation on capturing the "Monster of Paradise Falls," leading him to sacrifice decades of his life and his moral integrity to prove his skeptics wrong. | Ruthlessness: Exhibiting a total lack of empathy, willing to eliminate anyone—including an elderly fan and a young child—who stands between him and his objective. | Cleverness: Technological Supremacy |Arrogance: Utilizing his genius-level intellect to create advanced canine-translation collars and a massive dirigible, asserting his dominance over nature and his subjects through technological control.</villain:personalityDetails>
