    <villain:personalityDetails>Infamous butcher: Nicknamed "The Butcher of Krakow" | Sadism: Deriving gratification from the random and unpredictable execution of prisoners, asserting a divine-like authority to decide who lives or dies without any rational cause. | Corruption: Moral Decay — Engaging in extensive embezzlement and black-market activities for personal enrichment, demonstrating a total lack of any "higher" principle beyond self-gratification.</villain:personalityDetails>
