    <villain:personalityDetails>Physical Discipline: Obsessively maintaining the smallest waist in three counties, a physical manifestation of her vanity and the rigid social expectations she both performs and subverts. | Narcissism: Possessing a profound self-centeredness that allows her to ignore social taboos and the feelings of others (e.g., Melanie or Rhett) to satisfy her own desires. | Charisma: Weaponized Femininity — Expertly utilizing Southern social graces and flirting as tactical tools to achieve political or economic leverage in a male-dominated society.</villain:personalityDetails>
