    <villain:personalityTraits>Violent; Authoritarian Self-Righteousness; Sadistic Dominance; Moral Hypocrisy; Cynical Pragmatism; Symbolic Incompetence</villain:personalityTraits>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Violent"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Authoritarian_Self-Righteousness"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Sadistic_Dominance"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Moral_Hypocrisy"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Cynical_Pragmatism"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Symbolic_Incompetence"/>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Violent</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Authoritarian Self-Righteousness</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Sadistic Dominance</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Moral Hypocrisy</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Cynical Pragmatism</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Symbolic Incompetence</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityDetails>Authoritarian Self-Righteousness: Enforcing a personal version of justice through a rigid interpretation of the law to validate the use of excessive and systemic violence. | Sadistic Dominance: Deriving psychological satisfaction from physically brutalizing others to maintain an unchallenged position of absolute power within a social hierarchy. | Moral Hypocrisy: Condemning the violent nature of outlaws and gunslingers while simultaneously employing ruthless tactics and disregarding the inherent dignity of victims. | Cynical Pragmatism: Rejecting idealized notions of heroism or fairness in favor of a cold belief that only those with the unyielding will to exert violence can maintain order. | Symbolic Incompetence: Manifesting internal moral flaws and a lack of true structural integrity through the obsessive yet failed construction of a personal domain, exemplified by a leaking house.</villain:personalityDetails>
    <schema1:description>Authoritarian Self-Righteousness: Enforcing a personal version of justice through a rigid interpretation of the law to validate the use of excessive and systemic violence. | Sadistic Dominance: Deriving psychological satisfaction from physically brutalizing others to maintain an unchallenged position of absolute power within a social hierarchy. | Moral Hypocrisy: Condemning the violent nature of outlaws and gunslingers while simultaneously employing ruthless tactics and disregarding the inherent dignity of victims. | Cynical Pragmatism: Rejecting idealized notions of heroism or fairness in favor of a cold belief that only those with the unyielding will to exert violence can maintain order. | Symbolic Incompetence: Manifesting internal moral flaws and a lack of true structural integrity through the obsessive yet failed construction of a personal domain, exemplified by a leaking house.</schema1:description>
    <villain:abilities>Gunmanship</villain:abilities>
    <schema1:knowsAbout>Gunmanship</schema1:knowsAbout>
    <villain:hasAbility rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/ability/Gunmanship"/>
    <villain:occupation>Sheriff</villain:occupation>
    <schema1:jobTitle>Sheriff</schema1:jobTitle>
    <foaf:title>Sheriff</foaf:title>
  </rdf:Description>
