    <villain:personalityTrait>Corrupt Loyalty</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityDetails>External Mask: Paradoxical Facade — Maintaining a facade of paternalistic concern and "friendliness" to mask a parasitic system of extortion and labor exploitation. | Authoritarianism: Enforcing absolute control over the waterfront through the systematic use of violence, intimidation, and cold-blooded murder. | Greedy: Exploiting the labor of the working class to fuel a criminal enterprise while viewing human lives as disposable commodities for profit. | Corrupt Loyalty: Prioritizing the "code of silence" and organized crime alliances over legal standards and the welfare of the union members.</villain:personalityDetails>
    <schema1:description>External Mask: Paradoxical Facade — Maintaining a facade of paternalistic concern and "friendliness" to mask a parasitic system of extortion and labor exploitation. | Authoritarianism: Enforcing absolute control over the waterfront through the systematic use of violence, intimidation, and cold-blooded murder. | Greedy: Exploiting the labor of the working class to fuel a criminal enterprise while viewing human lives as disposable commodities for profit. | Corrupt Loyalty: Prioritizing the "code of silence" and organized crime alliances over legal standards and the welfare of the union members.</schema1:description>
    <villain:occupation>Union Boss</villain:occupation>
    <schema1:jobTitle>Union Boss</schema1:jobTitle>
    <foaf:title>Union Boss</foaf:title>
