    <villain:personalityTrait>Cleverness</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>High intelligence</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Even attempts to kill Truman</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>God Complex</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Manipulative Rationalization</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Artistic Detachment</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Paternalistic Authority</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Ethical Indifference</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityDetails>God Complex: Exercising total control over a fabricated world and viewing oneself as the divine architect of another human's reality. | Manipulative Rationalization: Justifying the systemic exploitation and imprisonment of an individual under the guise of providing a safer, idyllic life. | Artistic Detachment: Prioritizing the perfection of a creative vision and commercial success over basic human rights and individual autonomy. | Paternalistic Authority: Maintaining a facade of fatherly care to manipulate emotions and ensure compliance within a controlled environment. | Ethical Indifference: Disregarding moral boundaries and the psychological consequences of non-consensual surveillance for the sake of global entertainment.</villain:personalityDetails>
    <schema1:description>God Complex: Exercising total control over a fabricated world and viewing oneself as the divine architect of another human's reality. | Manipulative Rationalization: Justifying the systemic exploitation and imprisonment of an individual under the guise of providing a safer, idyllic life. | Artistic Detachment: Prioritizing the perfection of a creative vision and commercial success over basic human rights and individual autonomy. | Paternalistic Authority: Maintaining a facade of fatherly care to manipulate emotions and ensure compliance within a controlled environment. | Ethical Indifference: Disregarding moral boundaries and the psychological consequences of non-consensual surveillance for the sake of global entertainment.</schema1:description>
    <villain:abilities>Controls all of Truman's movements (brainwashing)</villain:abilities>
    <schema1:knowsAbout>Controls all of Truman's movements (brainwashing)</schema1:knowsAbout>
    <villain:hasAbility rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/ability/Controls_all_of_Trumans_movements_brainwashing"/>
    <villain:occupation>Director</villain:occupation>
    <schema1:jobTitle>Director</schema1:jobTitle>
    <foaf:title>Director</foaf:title>
  </rdf:Description>
