    <villain:personalityTrait>Existential Paranoia</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Egoism</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityDetails>Strategic Opportunism: Executing patient and calculated maneuvers to isolate targets and ensure the continued propagation of the species across the biosphere. | Existential Paranoia: Inducing total distrust and psychological collapse among host groups by exploiting the inability to distinguish friend from foe. | Egoism: Driven by a singular, relentless focus on self-preservation and expansion, viewing all other life forms merely as raw material for assimilation.</villain:personalityDetails>
    <schema1:description>Strategic Opportunism: Executing patient and calculated maneuvers to isolate targets and ensure the continued propagation of the species across the biosphere. | Existential Paranoia: Inducing total distrust and psychological collapse among host groups by exploiting the inability to distinguish friend from foe. | Egoism: Driven by a singular, relentless focus on self-preservation and expansion, viewing all other life forms merely as raw material for assimilation.</schema1:description>
    <villain:abilities>Can change shape and infect people down to their cells, capable of destroying humans; Shapeshifter; Invincible; Can survive for thousands of years</villain:abilities>
