    <villain:personalityTraits>High intelligence; Deceitfulness; Incestuous; God Complex; Predatory Narcissism; Nihilistic Visionary; Deceptive Civility; Absolute Hubris; Ephebophilia </villain:personalityTraits>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/High_intelligence"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Deceitfulness"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Incestuous"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/God_Complex"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Predatory_Narcissism"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Nihilistic_Visionary"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Deceptive_Civility"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Absolute_Hubris"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Ephebophilia"/>
    <villain:personalityTrait>High intelligence</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Deceitfulness</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Incestuous</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>God Complex</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Predatory Narcissism</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Nihilistic Visionary</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Deceptive Civility</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Absolute Hubris</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Ephebophilia</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityDetails>God Complex: Absolute Dominion — Exercising total control over vital natural resources and human lives, driven by the belief that immense power grants immunity from morality and law. | Predatory Narcissism: Transgressive Ownership — Violating the most sacred human boundaries, including incest and betrayal, to satisfy a pathological need for total domination over one's legacy. | Nihilistic Visionary: Amoral Pragmatism — Dismissing horrific crimes as mere steps toward "the future" and viewing human suffering with chilling indifference for the sake of long-term control. | Deceptive Civility: Aristocratic Facade — Maintaining a mask of a respectable, elderly statesman to conceal a monstrous interior that stops at nothing to expand its domain. | Absolute Hubris: Societal Untouchability — Assuming an eternal right to dictate the survival of entire communities while feeling fundamentally immune to any legal or social consequences.</villain:personalityDetails>
    <schema1:description>God Complex: Absolute Dominion — Exercising total control over vital natural resources and human lives, driven by the belief that immense power grants immunity from morality and law. | Predatory Narcissism: Transgressive Ownership — Violating the most sacred human boundaries, including incest and betrayal, to satisfy a pathological need for total domination over one's legacy. | Nihilistic Visionary: Amoral Pragmatism — Dismissing horrific crimes as mere steps toward "the future" and viewing human suffering with chilling indifference for the sake of long-term control. | Deceptive Civility: Aristocratic Facade — Maintaining a mask of a respectable, elderly statesman to conceal a monstrous interior that stops at nothing to expand its domain. | Absolute Hubris: Societal Untouchability — Assuming an eternal right to dictate the survival of entire communities while feeling fundamentally immune to any legal or social consequences.</schema1:description>
    <villain:occupation>Criminal mastermind</villain:occupation>
    <schema1:jobTitle>Criminal mastermind</schema1:jobTitle>
    <foaf:title>Criminal mastermind</foaf:title>
  </rdf:Description>
