    <villain:personalityTrait>Phobic Weaponization</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityDetails>Rebirth: Erasing the original persona of Jonathan Crane to fully embrace the "Scarecrow" identity as a defense mechanism against irreversible mental trauma. | Phobic Weaponization: Deriving authority and control by identifying and exploiting the deepest primal phobias of targets.</villain:personalityDetails>
    <schema1:description>Rebirth: Erasing the original persona of Jonathan Crane to fully embrace the "Scarecrow" identity as a defense mechanism against irreversible mental trauma. | Phobic Weaponization: Deriving authority and control by identifying and exploiting the deepest primal phobias of targets.</schema1:description>
    <villain:abilities>Systematically dismantling the psyches of others using fear-inducing toxins to validate the power of terror.</villain:abilities>
    <schema1:knowsAbout>Systematically dismantling the psyches of others using fear-inducing toxins to validate the power of terror.</schema1:knowsAbout>
    <villain:hasAbility rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/ability/Systematically_dismantling_the_psyches_of_others_using_fear-inducing_toxins_to_validate_the_power_of_terror"/>
    <villain:occupation>Chemist; Drug trafficker</villain:occupation>
