    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Bureaucratic_Arrogance"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Vengeful_Pettiness"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Moral_Bankruptcy"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Political_Opportunism"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Elite_Pretentiousness"/>
    <villain:hasPersonalityTrait rdf:resource="http://villainscope.org/trait/Cleverness"/>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Bureaucratic Arrogance</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Vengeful Pettiness</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Moral Bankruptcy</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Political Opportunism</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Elite Pretentiousness</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityTrait>Cleverness</villain:personalityTrait>
    <villain:personalityDetails>Bureaucratic Arrogance: Masking professional incompetence with an elitist and condescending attitude toward colleagues and subordinates. | Vengeful Pettiness: Prioritizing personal grudges and professional jealousy over the integrity of judicial investigations and the pursuit of truth. | Moral Bankruptcy: Abandoning justice and shielding violent criminals to secure institutional power and political favors. | Political Opportunism: Exploiting state-sponsored violence and political turmoil to eliminate rivals and solidify personal authority. | Elite Pretentiousness: Maintaining a facade of intellectual superiority to evade accountability for moral failures and professional negligence.</villain:personalityDetails>
    <schema1:description>Bureaucratic Arrogance: Masking professional incompetence with an elitist and condescending attitude toward colleagues and subordinates. | Vengeful Pettiness: Prioritizing personal grudges and professional jealousy over the integrity of judicial investigations and the pursuit of truth. | Moral Bankruptcy: Abandoning justice and shielding violent criminals to secure institutional power and political favors. | Political Opportunism: Exploiting state-sponsored violence and political turmoil to eliminate rivals and solidify personal authority. | Elite Pretentiousness: Maintaining a facade of intellectual superiority to evade accountability for moral failures and professional negligence.</schema1:description>
    <villain:occupation>Judicial officer</villain:occupation>
    <schema1:jobTitle>Judicial officer</schema1:jobTitle>
    <foaf:title>Judicial officer</foaf:title>
  </rdf:Description>
